          ],
          "block_id": "h0007",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "2.2 实验环节与考核方式",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": 3,
          "size": 11,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": "18384a"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            52.0,
            480.6,
            542.0,
            496.1
          ],
          "block_id": "t00007",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "实验环节占总评的较大比重，包含剖析实验、规则实验与综合项目三部分，考核方式结合过程记录、同伴评审与",
          "parent_id": "h0007",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            52.0,
            496.1,
            542.0,
            511.6
          ],
          "block_id": "t00007",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "期末方案答辩。评分标准强调可复现性与论证质量，教师依据统一量规打分，并在课程结束前向学生反馈各项得",
          "parent_id": "h0007",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            52.0,
            511.6,
            162.0,
            527.1
          ],
          "block_id": "t00007",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "分依据，保证评价透明。",
          "parent_id": "h0007",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
